  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 4.1.0. Ease-of-use release. AddCqrs is hidden from IntelliSense and its direct use flagged (call AddCqrsGenerated); registration error messages now name the correct verb. New startup checks: CQRCONF007 (transactional outbox with no IUnitOfWork) and CQRCONF008 (queued run mode with a stream request). Pipeline behaviors now take a named RequestHandlerDelegate/StreamHandlerDelegate continuation, so a behavior can simply await next(). Request context factories can now hydrate asynchronously — derive from AsyncRequestContextFactory<TContext> and override CreateContextAsync to load request-scoped data before the pipeline runs; synchronous factories are unchanged. Post-handlers can now be outcome-aware (OutcomeAwarePostHandlerAttribute / IPostHandlerOutcomeAware): they receive the request's RequestOutcome — the returned value or the thrown exception — and run on both the success and exception paths, so concerns like auditing can classify on what the handler produced. Plain post-handlers keep their success-only behavior.",
